        "id": 1687194
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-10-07T20:46:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "given that device support is being added due to `java_fuzz_host` being insufficient, is the intent to retain `java_fuzz_host` as well or to deprecate it in preference to device fuzzing?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 48,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 48,
        "endChar": 53
      },
      "revId": "cc97b4808d6c3fea74abf091df7869d514733983",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "878d322b_dfbc892f",
        "filename": "java/fuzz.go",
        "patchSetId": 6
      },
      "lineNbr": 48,
      "author": {
        "id": 1868610
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-10-11T18:07:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The intention is to keep both for now. Some fuzzers can be fuzzed on host, while all fuzzers can be fuzzed on device, however, host fuzzers are easier to scale up. We attempted to build both host and device fuzzers using a single module, `asan` sanitization doesn\u0027t work for device fuzzers, so we decided to keep them separate.",
      "parentUuid": "9f2936e8_26e98bc5",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 48,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 48,
        "endChar": 53
      },
      "revId": "cc97b4808d6c3fea74abf091df7869d514733983",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "06e90440_c244daf8",
        "filename": "java/fuzz.go",
        "patchSetId": 6
      },
      "lineNbr": 113,
      "author": {
        "id": 1687194
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-10-07T20:46:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do you need to consider 32 vs 64 bit (a la https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:build/soong/java/java.go;l\u003d1164;drc\u003d0b5f7f153f9c07e5eaf674594e9c4741168c0c99) given that you are using `MultiTargets` above for adding your library dependencies?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 110,
        "startChar": 3,
        "endLine": 113,
        "endChar": 28
      },
      "revId": "cc97b4808d6c3fea74abf091df7869d514733983",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
