      "writtenOn": "2022-10-12T14:16:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This would be most relevant for device -- what product have you lunched when you tested this on for device? Most 64-bit products will build for both 64-bit and 32-bit, not accounting for this would result in both the 32-bit and 64-bit libraries being written to the same output path, causing conflicts in ninja",
